'''PUBG Mobile World Cup 2025''' is the mid-season international event of the 2025 PUBG Mobile competitive season.

'''PUBG Mobile''' was announced to continue being part of the game titles line-up in the second edition of the '''Esports World Cup (EWC)''' on December 7th, 2024.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://youtube.com/clip/Ugkxg55ZE16DXhjAULnCOUxcKZGfDLnUfF_i?si=vwyp96v3llihI6YC |title=PUBG Mobile 2025 Roadmap announcement |date=2024-12-07|author=PUBG Mobile|language={{FlagNoLink|usuk}} English}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |url=https://x.com/EWC_EN/status/1865395846629490860 |title=We’re so back! 🙌 |date=2024-12-07 |author=Esports World Cup|language={{FlagNoLink|usuk}} English}}</ref>

==About==
===Format===
* '''Group Stage:''''' July 25th - 27th, 2025
** 24 teams, divided into 3 groups of 8.
** 18 matches (6 each day).
*** Each group play 12 matches overall.
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 8 teams}} advance to ''Grand Finals''.
** {{Bgcolortext|stay|Bottom 16 teams}} advance to ''Survival Stage''.
<div style="margin-top:1em"></div>
* '''Survival Stage:''''' July 29th - 30th, 2025
** 16 teams.
** 12 matches (6 each day).
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 8 teams}} advance to ''Grand Finals''.
** {{Bgcolortext|down|Bottom 8 teams}} are eliminated.
<div style="margin-top:1em"></div>
* '''Grand Finals:''''' August 1st - 3rd, 2025
** 16 teams:
*** {{Bgcolortext|stayup|Top 8 teams}} from ''Group Stage''.
*** {{Bgcolortext|stayup|Top 8 teams}} from ''Survival Stage''.
** 18 matches (6 each day).
** '''Smash Rule''' is applied in Day 3. {{SmashRule|margin-left=2em|section=SmashRuleGF|matchpoint=Top 1's point after Match #12 + 10|maxmatch=6}}
<br/>
{{Points10|showtb=true}}

