'''PUBG Mobile World Cup 2026''' is the mid-season international event of the 2026 PUBG Mobile competitive season. It was originally planned to be hosted in Riyadh, Saudi Arabia, but was moved to Paris, France on May 20.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/EWC_EN/status/2057121960623006162|title=Esports World Cup 2026 is coming to Paris|author=Esports World Cup|author-link=Esports World Cup|date=2026-05-20}}</ref>

==About==
===Format===
* '''Group Stage:''''' August 6th - 9th, 2026
** 32 teams, divided equally into 2 groups of 16.
** Each group plays 12 matches.
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 5 teams of each group}} advance to ''Grand Finals''.
** {{Bgcolortext|stay|6th - 13th place of each group}} advance to ''Survival Stage.
** {{Bgcolortext|down|Bottom 3 teams of each group}} are eliminated.
{{VerticalMargin}}
* '''Survival Stage:''''' August 11th - 12th, 2026
** 16 teams.
** 12 matches.
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 6 teams}} advance to ''Grand Finals''.
** {{Bgcolortext|down|Bottom 10 teams}} are eliminated.
{{VerticalMargin}}
* '''Grand Finals:''''' August 14th - 16th, 2026
** 16 teams:
*** {{Bgcolortext|stayup|10 teams}} from Group Stage
*** {{Bgcolortext|stayup|6 teams}} from Survival Stage
** Maximum of 18 matches (6 each day).
** '''Smash Rule''' is applied in Day 3. {{SmashRule|margin-left=2em|section=SmashRuleGF|matchpoint=Top 1's point after Match #12 + 10|maxmatch=6}}
{{VerticalMargin}}
{{Points10}}

